# Loops. GUIDE: REC captures what VOX and PULSE play; LOOP shows a captured one as steps, and its
# knobs edit them; REC again lets them all go. PLAY: REC records VOX from the keys, a bar from the next
# bar line, then it loops.
wait 1000
tap ARP
expect mode 1
turn K2 32
wait 30000
tap REC
expect loop1 1
expect loop2 1
expect dirty 2
tap SEQ
expect view 3
shot loop_vox.png
turn K1 2
turn K2 3
turn K3 1
turn K4 10
wait 30000
expect vox_notes >0
tap REC
expect loop1 0
expect loop2 0
tap ARP
tap ARP
expect mode 0
tap REC
expect rec 1
wait 2700
key w0 down
wait 600
key w0 up
key w4 down
wait 600
key w4 up
key w2 down
wait 600
key w2 up
wait 3000
expect rec 0
expect loop1 2
shot loop_rec.png
wait 6000
expect vox_notes >2
expect clips 0
